        "description": "The school, degree and discipline lists a board's application form offers, with their ids; schools can be searched by name. Pass `next_page` back as `page`, null on the last page.\n\nEvery response includes `credits_used`: the credits this call cost.\n\nPrice: 1 credit per successful call. Docs: https://api.sh/docs/greenhouse-education",
